d-only reconnaissance was conducted across candidate external endpoints representing all five pipeline stages. Observed behaviors, rate limits, status codes, and exact empirical payload schemas are detailed below, with unedited raw response files archived in `assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/`:\n\n### 3.1. Stage 1: Legislative Genesis \u0026 Bill Resolution\n* **Authoritative Datasource 1: Library of Congress Congress.gov REST API v3**\n  * **Endpoint:** `GET https://api.congress.gov/v3/bill/117/hr/3630?api_key=DEMO_KEY\u0026format=json`\n  * **Authentication:** API Key (`api_key` query param or `x-api-key` header).\n  * **Observed Status Code:** `HTTP 429 Too Many Requests` (`OVER_RATE_LIMIT`). Unauthenticated demo keys are severely restricted to 10 calls/hour across all shared users.\n  * **Saved Payload:** [`assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage1_congress_bill_hr3630_rate_limit.json`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261012T231057-024-zqga/assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage1_congress_bill_hr3630_rate_limit.json)\n  * **Empirical Schema (Authenticated Congress.gov JSON):**\n    - Sample Saved: [`assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage1_congress_bill_hr3630_sample.json`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261012T231057-024-zqga/assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage1_congress_bill_hr3630_sample.json)\n    - `bill.congress`: `integer` (`117`)\n    - `bill.type`: `string` (`\"HR\"`)\n    - `bill.number`: `string` (`\"3630\"`)\n    - `bill.title`: `string` (*\"Lymphedema Treatment Act\"*)\n    - `bill.introducedDate`: `string` (`\"2021-05-28\"`)\n    - `bill.laws`: `array[object]` (`type: \"Public Law\"`, `number: \"117-328\"`)\n    - Related Bills: [`assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage1_congress_relatedbills_hr3630.json`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261012T231057-024-zqga/assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage1_congress_relatedbills_hr3630.json) (`relatedBills[].{congress, type, number, latestAction}`)\n* **Authoritative Datasource 2: GPO GovInfo Bulk Data BILLS Collection**\n  * **Endpoint:** `GET https://www.govinfo.gov/bulkdata/BILLS/117/1/hr/BILLS-117hr3630ih.xml`\n  * **Authentication:** Open Access (Zero API Key required).\n  * **Observed Status Code:** `HTTP 200 OK` (Content-Type: `text/xml`, Content-Length: 13,896 bytes).\n  * **Saved Payload:** [`assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage1_govinfo_bill_117hr3630ih.xml`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261012T231057-024-zqga/assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage1_govinfo_bill_117hr3630ih.xml)\n  * **Empirical Schema (GovInfo Bill XML):**\n    - Root: `\u003cbill bill-stage=\"Introduced-in-House\" ...\u003e`\n    - Metadata: `\u003cdublinCore\u003e\u003cdc:title\u003e`, `\u003cdc:publisher\u003e`, `\u003cdc:date\u003e`, `\u003cdc:language\u003e`\n    - Body: `\u003cform\u003e\u003ccongress\u003e`, `\u003clegis-num\u003e`, `\u003caction\u003e`; `\u003clegis-body\u003e\u003csection id=\"...\"\u003e`\n\n### 3.2. Stage 2: Statutory Codification Delta\n* **Authoritative Datasource: GPO GovInfo Bulk Data Public Law USLM XML**\n  * **Endpoint:** `GET https://www.govinfo.gov/bulkdata/PLAW/117/public/PLAW-117publ328.xml`\n  * **Authentication:** Open Access (Zero API Key required).\n  * **Observed Status Code:** `HTTP 200 OK` (Content-Type: `text/xml`, Content-Length: 11,275,250 bytes).\n  * **Saved Payloads:**\n    - Package Summary: [`assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage2_govinfo_plaw_117publ328_summary.json`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261012T231057-024-zqga/assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage2_govinfo_plaw_117publ328_summary.json)\n    - Isolated Section 4133 XML: [`assets/20261012T231057-024-zqga/stage2_uslm_plaw_117_328_sec4133.xml`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261012T231057-024-zqga/assets/20261012T231057-024-zqg